@startuml test_configurations
' Test configuration for text overlap investigation
' Version: PlantUML 1.2024.8 compatibility test

!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

' === Test 1: Maximum spacing configuration ===
skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor #LightBlue
    Padding 50
    FontSize 8
}

skinparam note {
    FontSize 8
    Padding 25
    WordWrap true
    BorderThickness 1
}

skinparam sequence {
    ParticipantPadding 100
    BoxPadding 40
    MessageAlignment center
}

' === Test 2: Font specifications ===
skinparam DefaultFontName Arial
skinparam DefaultFontSize 8
skinparam TitleFontSize 10

' === Test 3: Advanced settings (may not work in old versions) ===
skinparam minClassWidth 250
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam groupPadding 30
skinparam dividerBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam dividerFontSize 9

' === Test 4: DPI and quality settings ===
skinparam dpi 150

title Test Configuration for Text Overlap Prevention

' Short participant names to minimize overlap
participant "CAM" as C #LightGreen
participant "Queue" as Q #LightYellow
participant "TCP" as T #LightCyan

C -> Q: push
note over Q #LightYellow
Test note with
multiple lines
to check overlap
end note

Q -> T: pull
note over T #LightCyan
TCP processing
236ms duration
end note

== Test Section ==

C -> Q: frame data
Q -> T: process

@enduml